  "project_description": "Decimal field type that stores values as VARCHAR strings rather than the core DECIMAL SQL column, so very large or very high-precision numbers keep exact digits. Ships a field type (decimal_string), matching widget and formatter, a reusable decimal_string form element, and two services (decimal.normalizer, decimal.formatter) built on brick/math BigDecimal. Requires the BCMath PHP extension for max-precision arithmetic.",
